<description id="description">
<?brief-description-of-drawings description="Brief Description of Drawings" end="lead"?>
<description-of-drawings>
<p id="p-0001" num="0001">1. Fruit gum</p>
<p id="p-0002" num="0002">The design relates to a bear face made of fruit gums; fig. <figref idref="DRAWINGS"><b>1</b>.<b>1</b> </figref>shows an overall view from above; fig. <figref idref="DRAWINGS"><b>1</b>.<b>2</b> </figref>shows an overall view from the bottom; fig. <figref idref="DRAWINGS"><b>1</b>.<b>3</b> </figref>shows an overall view from the front; fig. <figref idref="DRAWINGS"><b>1</b>.<b>4</b> </figref>shows an overall view from the left side; fig. <figref idref="DRAWINGS"><b>1</b>.<b>5</b> </figref>shows an overall view from the right side; <figref idref="DRAWINGS">fig</figref>. <b>1</b>.<b>6</b> shows an overall view from the back; fig. <figref idref="DRAWINGS"><b>1</b>.<b>7</b> </figref>and <figref idref="DRAWINGS"><b>1</b>.<b>8</b> </figref>show overall perspective views.</p>
</description-of-drawings>
